# Allowlist context for a future Python package image.
# Ignore everything, then re-include only runtime packaging inputs.
**

!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!RUNGENT.md
!LICENSE
!src/
!src/**

# Never ship local junk even if matched above
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
